# Our entry in the front Caddy of the server (ADR 0024). up.sh puts this
# file into the shared Docker volume `caddy-sites` as stammtisch.caddy; the
# front Caddy (Haushalt app, label edge.caddy=true) imports every *.caddy
# file in it and is reloaded without a restart. A domain change for the game
# therefore needs only this repo.
#
# The front Caddy terminates HTTPS (it fetches the certificates) and hands
# everything to our own Caddy (`web`, alias stammtisch-web, deploy/Caddyfile)
# through the shared network `edge`. Each host name may appear only once on
# the whole server, or the front Caddy refuses the new configuration.

# The old sslip.io address keeps serving the game until the players' local
# progress has moved to the new domain (game data in the browser belongs to
# the address).
stammtisch-62-83-23-90.sslip.io, one-more-skat.de {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy stammtisch-web:80
}

www.one-more-skat.de {
	redir https://one-more-skat.de{uri} permanent
}
